# GAMADA site — copy to .env.local (never commit it). Only VITE_* variables reach the browser bundle.

# --- AI proxy (Demo Kit "Live" mode) --------------------------------------------
# The demo always works without it: Simulation is the default and Live is offered only when
# GET {VITE_AI_PROXY_URL}/api/ai/health answers live:true.
#
#   (variable absent)          → Live off, nothing is fetched (safe default for any build)
#   VITE_AI_PROXY_URL=         → same origin: /api/ai/*  (dev: vite.config.ts proxies it to
#                                http://127.0.0.1:8787 — run `npm run ai:mock` or `npm run ai:dev`)
#   VITE_AI_PROXY_URL=https://ai.example.com
#                              → a deployed proxy; its ALLOWED_ORIGINS must list this site's origin
#
# Wire protocol and proxy setup: server/ai-proxy/README.md ("Protokol SSE").
VITE_AI_PROXY_URL=

# The dev proxy target defaults to http://127.0.0.1:8787; to change it set AI_PROXY_TARGET in the
# SHELL environment before `npm run dev` (vite.config.ts reads process.env, not this file).
